#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: flooring-calculator.php
msgid "Flooring Calculator for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Flooring Calculator for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
#: flooring-calculator.php
msgid "https://www.cms-admins.de/"
msgstr "https://www.cms-admins.de/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: flooring-calculator.php
msgid ""
"Converts between area, length and sales unit on WooCommerce product pages "
"and shows the total price instantly. For flooring, underlay, adhesives, "
"skirting boards, panels and profiles."
msgstr ""
"Rechnet auf WooCommerce-Produktseiten zwischen Fläche, Länge und "
"Verkaufseinheit um und zeigt den Gesamtpreis sofort an. Für Bodenbeläge, "
"Unterlagen, Klebstoffe, Leisten, Paneele und Profile."

#. Author of the plugin
#: flooring-calculator.php
msgid "CMS ADMINS"
msgstr "CMS ADMINS"

